From: Harshit Gupta <39994376+arelyx@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Tue, 27 Oct 2026 05:40:32 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] freedreno/a2xx: derivatives and texelFetch in ir2

- ddx/ddy (fine and coarse) through the getGradients fetch, which returns
  d/dx and d/dy of its source's x in .x and .y; vector derivatives are
  split per component first.
- txf on 2D and rectangle textures becomes a txl at the texel center with
  unnormalized coordinates; Mesa's blits and glCopyTexImage use it.

ir2 aborted on both before. piglit glsl-derivs, glsl-fwidth and
fbo-deriv pass on Xenos; copyteximage and the depth/stencil blit tests no
longer crash.

